VIEW
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  lsblk -f                  Devices + filesystems
  findmnt                   Mount tree
  mount                     Current mounts
  df -h                     Mounted filesystem usage


MOUNT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  sudo mount /dev/sdX1 /mnt
                              Mount partition

  sudo mount -a              Mount everything in fstab


UNMOUNT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  sudo umount /mnt/path     Unmount filesystem


IDENTIFY
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  lsblk -f                  Find UUID
  blkid                     Find UUID + filesystem
  findmnt /path              Find device mounted at path


FSTAB
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  /etc/fstab                Persistent mount configuration

  Test changes:
    sudo mount -a

  If it returns without errors:
    fstab syntax is valid
